  "details": "The new Instance performance gate system is really great and is really going to help with managing the overall performance for people in an instance. It would be great though if we can grant an individual have a temporary ability to be in a poor or very poor and even maybe set a time frame they can be in a poor avatar without having to give them a role within the group. In RP groups this would be helpful with granting the ability to be in a poor avatar for a specific scene, and for club groups it could be used to give guests from other groups or places to be in poor avatars for performances without giving them a role and having to remove it after.",
